### Admin request records
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/api-requests?limit=25&minStatusCode=400
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Request statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/api-requests/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Request detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/api-requests/{{requestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Common error: ordinary users receive 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/api-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

